# SmartAsset

> SmartAsset is an online destination for consumer-focused financial information and advice that powers SmartAsset AMP, a national marketplace connecting consumers to financial advisors.

**How we help financial advisors**
SmartAsset is the nation’s largest marketplace connecting consumers to financial advisors.

Building on SmartAsset’s reach to millions of potential investors, SmartAsset AMP connects financial advisors directly with prospects who meet their ideal client profile. Available in three plan levels – Discover, Accelerate, and Scale – SmartAsset AMP allows advisors to access referral generation, nurture 
campaigns, automated calling and texting, and live connections – all for a simple monthly subscription. 

SmartAsset AMP will enable advisors to grow confidently at every plan level with clear expectations around bottom-line drivers like client conversion, meeting set rates, assets under management (AUM) targets, and more.

**How we help consumers**

SmartAsset offers a variety of tools and educational resources to empower you on your path toward financial well-being and goal achievement, including financial advisor matches, as well as calculators, tools and educational resources for everything from home buying to retirement. 

